PhotoEditorResult runEditor(HWND owner,Editor& editor){WNDCLASSEXW c{sizeof(c)};c.hInstance=GetModuleHandleW(nullptr);c.lpfnWndProc=editorProc;c.lpszClassName=EditorClass;c.hCursor=LoadCursorW(nullptr,IDC_ARROW);c.hIcon=c.hIconSm=LoadIconW(c.hInstance,MAKEINTRESOURCEW(2));RegisterClassExW(&c);RECT r{};GetWindowRect(owner,&r);MONITORINFO monitor{sizeof(monitor)};GetMonitorInfoW(MonitorFromWindow(owner,MONITOR_DEFAULTTONEAREST),&monitor);int width=int(std::min(std::max(LONG(1000*GetDpiForWindow(owner)/96),r.right-r.left),monitor.rcWork.right-monitor.rcWork.left)),height=int(std::min(std::max(LONG(720*GetDpiForWindow(owner)/96),r.bottom-r.top),monitor.rcWork.bottom-monitor.rcWork.top));
 editor.window=CreateWindowExW(WS_EX_APPWINDOW,EditorClass,(L"PAF-Photos · "+std::wstring(FOTO_VERSION_WSTRING)).c_str(),WS_POPUP|WS_THICKFRAME|WS_MINIMIZEBOX|WS_MAXIMIZEBOX|WS_SYSMENU|WS_CLIPCHILDREN,r.left,r.top,width,height,owner,nullptr,c.hInstance,&editor);if(!editor.window)return {};BOOL dark=GetRValue(editor.style.background)+GetGValue(editor.style.background)+GetBValue(editor.style.background)<384;DwmSetWindowAttribute(editor.window,20,&dark,sizeof(dark));SendMessageW(editor.window,WM_SETICON,ICON_BIG,SendMessageW(owner,WM_GETICON,ICON_BIG,0));SendMessageW(editor.window,WM_SETICON,ICON_SMALL,SendMessageW(owner,WM_GETICON,ICON_SMALL,0));EnableWindow(owner,FALSE);ShowWindow(owner,SW_HIDE);ShowWindow(editor.window,SW_SHOW);MSG message{};while(!editor.done){int result=GetMessageW(&message,nullptr,0,0);if(result<=0){if(result==0)PostQuitMessage(int(message.wParam));if(IsWindow(editor.window))DestroyWindow(editor.window);break;}if(message.message==WM_KEYDOWN&&(message.wParam==VK_ESCAPE||((GetKeyState(VK_CONTROL)&0x8000)&&(message.wParam=='Z'||message.wParam=='Y'||message.wParam=='S'))||message.wParam==VK_SPACE)){SendMessageW(editor.window,message.message,message.wParam,message.lParam);continue;}if(message.message==WM_KEYUP&&message.wParam==VK_SPACE){SendMessageW(editor.window,message.message,message.wParam,message.lParam);continue;}if(!IsDialogMessageW(editor.window,&message)){TranslateMessage(&message);DispatchMessageW(&message);}}
 EnableWindow(owner,TRUE);ShowWindow(owner,SW_SHOW);SetForegroundWindow(owner);fontCache().clear();return editor.returned;
}
